flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7421055Z ^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7421771Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7422124Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7422292Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7422457Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7423067Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7423289Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7423435Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7423742Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7423886Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7424279Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7424970Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7425430Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7425767Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7425892Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7426031Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7426219Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7426377Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7426663Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7426772Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7426853Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7426984Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7427204Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7427561Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7431196Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7431579Z I will:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7431950Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7432189Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7432669Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7433177Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7433665Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7433910Z  - install Nix in /nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7434126Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7434430Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7444444Z    /root
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7444938Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7445365Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7453914Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:04:38.7454463Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
